                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For documentation on the meeting at Paris of the Foreign Ministers of France, the
                    United Kingdom, and the United States, November 9–11, primarily on German
                    matters, see <ref target="#pg305">pp. 305</ref> ff. Documents of this meeting
                    referring more specifically to reparations and dismantling are printed <hi
                        rendition="#italic">infra</hi>.</p>
            </div>
